    "description": "Unified agent memory for DeepSeek Harness — one shared Obsidian vault for every agent (dsh, Codex, Claude, Hermes). Ships the dependency-free Python core (search/promote/adjudicate/forget), a vault template, and a dsh plugin with six tools (memory_search / memory_show / memory_submit / memory_status / memory_preview / memory_setup). · 统一 Agent 记忆系统：多 Agent 共享一个 Obsidian vault，附零依赖 Python core 与 dsh 插件。",
